  "title": "FLIM Playground: A FLIM-focused framework for multimodal single-cell imaging",
  "description": "FLIM Playground is an interactive framework for extracting and analyzing single-cell measurements, centered on fluorescence lifetime imaging microscopy (FLIM). It extracts features from FLIM data, supports quantitative phase imaging (QPI) as an additional modality, and analyzes user-supplied CSV, TSV/TXT, Excel, and OpenDocument tables through interactive visual-analytic modules. The framework is designed to expand to additional imaging modalities. See the README for details.",
